  <section class="sec" id="experience">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal"><span class="eyebrow"><b>01</b>Experience</span><h2>Career <span class="serif">Experience</span></h2><p>Built websites. Tested banking apps. Now building Shopify stores that just work.</p></div>
      <div class="exp-wrap reveal" id="exp"><div class="exp-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Roles" aria-orientation="vertical">
    <button class="exp-tab" role="tab" id="exp-tab-0" aria-controls="exp-panel" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">
      <i class="org-ico" style="background:#5e8e3e" aria-hidden="true">F</i><b class="exp-full">Shopify Consultant, Developer &amp; Tester</b>
      <small><i class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></i>Now · Freelance</small>
      <span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
    </button><button class="exp-tab" role="tab" id="exp-tab-1" aria-controls="exp-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">
      <i class="org-ico" style="background:#86bc25" aria-hidden="true">D</i><b class="exp-full">Software Tester</b>
      <small>Deloitte</small>
      <span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
    </button><button class="exp-tab" role="tab" id="exp-tab-2" aria-controls="exp-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">
      <i class="org-ico" style="background:#e44d26" aria-hidden="true">F</i><b class="exp-full">Web Developer</b>
      <small>Freelance</small>
      <span class="chev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
    </button>
  </div>
  <article class="exp-panel spot" id="exp-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-live="polite" aria-labelledby="exp-tab-0" style="--org: #5e8e3e;">
    <div class="exp-head"><i class="org-ico" style="background:#5e8e3e" aria-hidden="true">F</i><span class="exp-org">Freelance</span>
      <div class="meta"><span class="now">Now</span><span>Remote</span></div>
    </div>
    <h3>Shopify Consultant, Developer &amp; Tester</h3>
    <p>Helping brands plan, build and launch Shopify stores that look great, load fast and are tested before a single customer sees them.</p>
    <ul class="checks"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 9.8"></path></svg><span>Shopify consulting: store strategy, apps and the right setup for your goals</span></li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 9.8"></path></svg><span>Store setup, theme customization and custom sections</span></li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 9.8"></path></svg><span>App integrations, payments and shipping configuration</span></li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 9.8"></path></svg><span>Speed and conversion optimization</span></li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 9.8"></path></svg><span>Full QA testing on every device and browser before launch</span></li></ul>
    <div class="tags"><span>Shopify</span><span>Liquid</span><span>Consulting</span><span>QA Testing</span></div>
    <span class="count" aria-hidden="true">01 / 03</span></article></div><!--/static-->
    </div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <!-- Photo strip and the line under it are hidden for now: remove "hidden" on both to bring them back -->
      <div class="strip" id="strip" hidden><div class="strip-track" id="strip-track"></div></div>
      <p class="strip-note reveal" hidden>You see the launch. I sweat the details: <b>every page tested, every click checked</b>, so your customers only see a store that works.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec alt" id="education">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center reveal"><span class="eyebrow"><b>02</b>Education</span><h2>Academic <span class="serif">Journey</span></h2><p>Three milestones that taught me how to learn, think and build.</p></div>
      <div class="edu reveal" id="edu"><div class="edu-rail" role="tablist" aria-label="Academic milestones">
    <div class="edu-track" aria-hidden="true"><i class="edu-fill" style="--p: 1;"></i></div>
    <button class="edu-node done" role="tab" id="edu-tab-0" aria-controls="edu-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">
      <span class="edu-pin"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 6.5C10.3 5.2 7.8 4.5 4 4.5v13c3.8 0 6.3.7 8 2 1.7-1.3 4.2-2 8-2v-13c-3.8 0-6.3.7-8 2z"></path><path d="M12 6.5v13"></path></svg></span><b>2017</b><small>Secondary</small>
    </button><button class="edu-node done" role="tab" id="edu-tab-1" aria-controls="edu-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">
      <span class="edu-pin"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V11l7-4 7 4v10"></path><path d="M12 7V3l3 1.5L12 6"></path><path d="M10 21v-4h4v4M8.5 13h.01M15.5 13h.01"></path></svg></span><b>2019</b><small>Senior Secondary</small>
    </button><button class="edu-node" role="tab" id="edu-tab-2" aria-controls="edu-panel" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">
      <span class="edu-pin"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 9.5L12 5l10 4.5L12 14 2 9.5z"></path><path d="M6 11.5V16c0 1.4 2.7 3 6 3s6-1.6 6-3v-4.5M22 9.5V15"></path></svg></span><b>2022</b><small>BCA Degree</small>
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="edu-panel spot" id="edu-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-live="polite" aria-labelledby="edu-tab-2">
    <div class="edu-big" aria-hidden="true">2022<small>2019 – 2022</small></div>
    <div class="edu-body">
      <em class="stage">Step 3 · Earning the Degree</em>
      <h3>Tilak Raj Chadha Institute of Management and Technology (TIMT)</h3>
      <p class="edu-deg">BCA, Kurukshetra University</p>
      <p class="edu-story">Three years of learning to build software properly. Programming, databases and the web became the foundation for everything I build today.</p>
      <ul class="tags" aria-label="What I took away"><li>Programming</li><li>Databases</li><li>Web development</li><li>Software testing</li></ul>
    </div>
    <span class="count" aria-hidden="true">03 / 03</span></div></div><!--/static-->
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" id="tools">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal"><span class="eyebrow"><b>03</b>Toolkit</span><h2>Tools &amp; <span class="serif">Capabilities</span></h2><p>Modern tools, proven skills and one goal: a store that sells more.</p></div>
      <div class="bento">
        <div class="b-tools spot reveal"><h3>Tools I use every day</h3><p class="sub">From building the store to researching what works.</p><div class="tool-grid" id="tools-top"><span class="tool"><i style="background:#95bf47" aria-hidden="true">S</i>Shopify</span><span class="tool"><i style="background:#10a37f" aria-hidden="true">C</i>ChatGPT</span><span class="tool"><i style="background:#d97757" aria-hidden="true">C</i>Claude</span><span class="tool"><i style="background:#4285f4" aria-hidden="true">GS</i>Google Search</span><span class="tool"><i style="background:#e44d26" aria-hidden="true">H</i>HTML</span><span class="tool"><i style="background:#264de4" aria-hidden="true">C</i>CSS</span><span class="tool"><i style="background:#f7df1e;color:#111" aria-hidden="true">J</i>JavaScript</span></div><!--/static--><p class="tool-note"><span class="live" aria-hidden="true"></span>Always exploring new AI tools to build faster and smarter.</p></div>
        <div class="b-skills spot reveal" style="--rd:.08s"><h3>What I can do for you</h3><p class="sub">Development, testing and consulting under one roof.</p><div class="skill-cloud" id="tools-bottom"><span>Shopify Consulting</span><span>Store Setup</span><span>Theme Development</span><span>Custom Sections</span><span>App Integration</span><span>Speed Optimization</span><span>Conversion Optimization</span><span>Mobile-First Design</span><span>Quality Testing</span><span>Cross-Browser Testing</span><span>Bug Fixing</span><span>Store Audits</span><span>Technical SEO</span></div><!--/static--></div>
        <div class="b-quote spot reveal" style="--rd:.12s"><p>A developer who tests like a QA engineer, so <span class="serif hl">nothing breaks</span> on launch day.</p><a class="btn btn-ink" href="#services">View Services <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {projects.length > 0 && (
  <section class="sec" id="projects">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal"><span class="eyebrow"><b>✦</b>Work</span><h2>Recent <span class="serif">Projects</span></h2><p>Real stores. Real brands. Built to look good and sell even better.</p></div>
      <div class="card-grid">{projects.slice(0, 3).map(p => <ProjectCard project={p} />)}</div>
      {projects.length > 3 && <div class="sec-foot"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/projects/">View all projects <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>}
    </div>
  </section>)}

  <section class="sec alt" id="process">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center reveal"><span class="eyebrow"><b>04</b>Process</span><h2>How I <span class="serif">Work</span></h2><p>No guesswork. No ghosting. Just a clear path from your idea to a store that sells.</p></div>
      <div class="process" id="process-list"><div class="pcard spot reveal" style="--rd:0s">
    <div class="num"><b>01</b><i aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
    <h3>I Listen First</h3><p>Before I touch a single line of code, I get to know your brand, your customers and what keeps you up at night. Your store is your hard work on display, and I treat it that way.</p>
    <span class="big" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
  </div>
  <div class="pcard spot reveal" style="--rd:0.08s">
    <div class="num"><b>02</b><i aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
    <h3>I Build It Like It's Mine</h3><p>I turn your vision into a store that feels like you, step by step, with regular updates so you're never left wondering. You see real progress, never excuses.</p>
    <span class="big" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
  </div>
  <div class="pcard spot reveal" style="--rd:0.16s">
    <div class="num"><b>03</b><i aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
    <h3>I Stay After Launch</h3><p>Every page, button and checkout is tested on every device before we go live. And launch day isn't goodbye: I stick around to fix, fine-tune and help your store grow.</p>
    <span class="big" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
  </div></div><!--/static-->
    </div>
  </section>

